Vendored browser libraries for the dashboard's 3D twin (strands_robots/dashboard/static/vendor/).

three.js r170 (https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js)
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2010-2024 three.js authors.
  Files: three.module.min.js (build/three.module.min.js, unmodified),
         OrbitControls.js (examples/jsm/controls/OrbitControls.js, with the
         bare `three` import rewritten to ./three.module.min.js).

Vendored rather than fetched from a CDN so the dashboard renders on a robot LAN
with no internet. No other third-party browser code is included; the twin's
geometry comes from the compiled MuJoCo model this process already holds.
